    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/4b637f8a3ff5c46a07f45dca1ce2882f.poster.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/4b637f8a3ff5c46a07f45dca1ce2882f.webm?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/4b637f8a3ff5c46a07f45dca1ce2882f.mp4?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Play With Your Cat!&quot;</i> is <strong>a virtual toy box</strong> for you and your beloved cat. This is<br>not a videogame in a conventional sense. This is a virtual <strong>toy collection</strong> that<br>gives you the tools for computer-mediated play with your cat buddies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are put in a key role in creating mutual play experiences with your animal<br>buddies. There is no right or wrong way to play, because it is all about<br>spontaneous moment-to-moment play. Just like when playing with a physical<br>toy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/c818686f2a46c4d939a71e7aa3f3295a.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/1b3848851b0b44bb834cbfba667c96ff.poster.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/1b3848851b0b44bb834cbfba667c96ff.webm?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/1b3848851b0b44bb834cbfba667c96ff.mp4?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest, one could describe this game as a glorified laser pointer. And<br>that would be somewhat accurate. The difference is that we give you a variety<br>of different characters and settings to interact and experiment with. All play<br>tested with our developer and QA cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a laser pointer, this is a very powerful and engaging stimulus for cats of<br>all ages and backgrounds. Suitable for cats who shy away from direct human<br>contact. Or owners with limited mobility who would still like to easily play with<br>their beloved pets from time to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/e7e0e654c8f8d8a0d1f6aa28c02c4c85.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/09f9ff4cfaec7903336d1c87929aa0ec.poster.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/09f9ff4cfaec7903336d1c87929aa0ec.webm?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/09f9ff4cfaec7903336d1c87929aa0ec.mp4?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 DESIGNED AND TESTED WITH THE REAL END-USERS: CATS </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 14 DIFFERENT PLAY MODES TO EXPERIMENT WITH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 CONTROLLER, KEYBOARD &amp; AI-PLAY SUPPORT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 COLORFUL VISUALS AND SMOOTH ANIMATIONS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 SOUNDSCAPES TO MATCH THE SETTINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 EASILY CHANGE THE VIRTUAL OBJECTS\u2019 SIZE AND SPEED DURING PLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 THE GAME THAT YOUR CAT ACTUALLY LOVES TO PLAY WITH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 CREATE CUSTOM AUTO-PLAY SESSIONS FOR YOUR CATS\u2019 ENTERTAINMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/7b80a9aecfbf7f159ab5f357c9701313.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/deb9e9bc933f180ae566b4f8f3d52b15.poster.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/deb9e9bc933f180ae566b4f8f3d52b15.webm?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/deb9e9bc933f180ae566b4f8f3d52b15.mp4?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 CONTROL THE ACTION YOURSELF OR USE AI-PLAY OPTION\u00a0\u2605</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the best experiences are still created together when actually playing<br>with your cat yourself. The AI option is mostly there to back you up when you<br>are busy or you just want to put something for the cats to watch. They also like<br>just watching the movement on the screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can easily switch between <strong>AI-PLAY</strong> and manual controlling if something<br>urgent comes during your play time. The show can go on regardless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/7cf8ef2b0715bd7f9a0df659b15eede0.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/49776dc6a32985f4e741951d0f9d0add.poster.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/49776dc6a32985f4e741951d0f9d0add.webm?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/49776dc6a32985f4e741951d0f9d0add.mp4?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built on a university study and has been designed and tested in<br>a feedback loop with the actual end users: cats. All of the game modes have<br>been playtested and validated entertainment-wise with our playtester cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have strongly reduced the amount of modern human-centric design choices<br>that offer cats no actual value. Instead, <i>&quot;Play With Your Cat!&quot;</i> focuses on mutually<br>invented moment-to-moment play to maximize the engagement and fun for<br>both the cats and their owners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/dd4159e22e224e70cef644d5709fab6d.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/5c99f94f56f4d9951c534813a834583a.poster.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/5c99f94f56f4d9951c534813a834583a.webm?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/5c99f94f56f4d9951c534813a834583a.mp4?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still not convinced? Why not try out the free demo. The two play modes available<br>in the demo were used in an actual university study. If your cat goes bananas with<br>either one of these two game modes, chances are that they will enjoy other ones<br>as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cat has their preferences regarding play. Find out the ones that your cat<br>loves the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/504df42cb190f5a1db894e1834b3c875.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember; play is a complementary interaction and it requires responsiveness<br>and respect from both parties involved. Observe your cat during play sessions.<br>See what kind of modes, movement patterns and play styles make <i>your</i> cat tic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So connect a controller or a keyboard to your device, take the role of the various<br>virtual game objects and start inventing mutual fun with your feline friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join our <strong>Discord</strong> server for any questions you may have and general play tips<br>on how to take your virtual play session to the next level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game might not appeal to each and every cat. This is why we suggest<br>you to try out the demo version beforehand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/4b637f8a3ff5c46a07f45dca1ce2882f.poster.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/4b637f8a3ff5c46a07f45dca1ce2882f.webm?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/4b637f8a3ff5c46a07f45dca1ce2882f.mp4?t=1750098050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Play With Your Cat!&quot;</i> is <strong>a virtual toy box</strong> for you and your beloved cat. This is<br>not a videogame in a conventional sense. This is a virtual <strong>toy collection</strong> that<br>gives you the tools for computer-mediated play with your cat buddies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are put in a key role in creating mutual play experiences with your animal<br>buddies. There is no right or wrong way to play, because it is all about<br>spontaneous moment-to-moment play. Just like when playing with a physical<br>toy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/c818686f2a46c4d939a71e7aa3f3295a.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596300/extras/1b3848851b0b44bb834cbfba667c96ff.poster.avif?t=1750098050\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25963