he role of the various<br>virtual game objects and start inventing mutual fun with your feline friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join our <strong>Discord</strong> server for any questions you may have and general play tips<br>on how to take your virtual play session to the next level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game might not appeal to each and every cat. This is why we suggest<br>you to try out the demo version beforehand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to Play With Your Cat! This is a virtual toy box that offers you the right tools for virtual play with your pets. It is a simple yet powerful tool built on a university study and designed in a feedback loop with the actual end-users: cats. There are no rules. You create the fun together!",
